      "code": "if (isstring(chr))\n            return lex_string;",
      "note": "After earlier space-delimited tokens, `lex_config()` reaches the final delimiter at copied offset 24944, skips it as whitespace, then sees `'V'` at offset 24945. Because that byte is not `$` and still satisfies `isstring(chr)`, control enters `lex_string()` for the last token that runs to EOF.",
